sequenceDiagram
    actor B as Buyer
    participant App as Desi Bazaar app
    participant S as Seller
    participant Sw as Buyer's Swish app
    participant SwS as Seller's Swish app
    B->>App: Reserve listing → order_placed
    App->>App: Atomic stock check + reservation (stock_reserved)
    App->>B: Show approved Swish recipient + exact SEK amount
    Note over B,Sw: Buyer pays OUTSIDE the app
    B->>Sw: Pay seller directly
    B->>App: Tap "I've paid" (assertion, not proof)
    App->>App: payment_reported — stock release stopped
    App->>S: Notify: payment reported, verify receipt
    S->>SwS: Check actual incoming Swish payment
    S->>App: Confirm receipt
    App->>App: payment_seller_confirmed — dispatch unlocked
    S->>App: Mark dispatched
    App->>B: Notify dispatch - delivery evidence or confirm receipt
    B->>App: Confirm receipt (receipt_confirmed)
    B->>App: Leave review (one per order)
